# UNLOCK — Learning Engine

Canonical semantics live in relevant ADRs and learning docs.

Stable guardrails:
- deterministic real-time learning behavior for the same persisted state/policy/explicit time;
- AI is not the Learning Engine;
- Attempts and QuestionVersions are immutable;
- historical Attempts stay tied to exact versions;
- learner state is evidence-based and reversible;
- use explicit time/timezone semantics;
- DailyPlan is the primary Today model;
- Manual Practice does not resolve Today items;
- Skip creates no learning evidence;
- no Course fairness quotas;
- New Material is deterministic fallback-only in V1 and does not fabricate mastery/progress.

Load ADR-016/017 when changing DailyPlan/New Material behavior rather than recreating those specifications here.
